cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SYNAPSE: Reproducible Computational Neuroscience Research Platform"
message: "Research Use Only (RUO). If you use SYNAPSE in computational research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SYNAPSE Contributors"
version: "0.1.0.dev0"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mburakmmm/synapse"
url: "https://github.com/mburakmmm/synapse"
abstract: >-
  Local-first, open-source computational research laboratory for connectome-grounded
  dynamical simulations in adult Drosophila melanogaster (Research Use Only).
  SYNAPSE enforces SHA-256 dataset provenance across FlyWire/FAFB v630 and Janelia
  MaleCNS v1.0, provides computational reproduction of the Shiu et al. (2024)
  leaky integrate-and-fire feeding circuit, includes a reproducible CLI, API,
  worker, and web laboratory workbench, and supports pre-registered frozen
  confirmatory simulation protocols such as P4-MET-001.
keywords:
  - computational neuroscience
  - reproducibility
  - leaky integrate-and-fire
  - connectomics
  - drosophila
  - research-use-only
